        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Bobby Petrino\n- Organizations: WKU Hilltoppers football, Louisville Cardinals football\n- Places: Houchens Industries–L. T. Smith Stadium\n- Events: 2013 WKU Hilltoppers football season\n- Topics: American football coaching\n\nFacts:\n- Bobby Petrino was born on March 10, 1961.\n- Bobby Petrino is an American football coach and former player.\n- In 2013, Bobby Petrino served as the first-year head coach of the WKU Hilltoppers football team.\n- In 2013, the WKU Hilltoppers football team played its home games at Houchens Industries–L. T. Smith Stadium.\n- In 2013, the WKU Hilltoppers football team finished the season with an 8–4 record.\n- In 2013, the WKU Hilltoppers football team went 4–3 in Sun Belt play and finished in a four-way tie for third place.\n- The Louisville Cardinals football team is currently coached by Bobby Petrino.",
